sketchBlocks.bodyMarkdown:
Once the repeated content blocks share a class, one CSS rule can give every card the same surface and inner spacing.

**Worked example:**

```css
.card {
  padding: var(--space-section);
  background-color: #fff;
}
```

**Line by line:** `.card` targets every element carrying the reusable class. `padding` uses the spacing token from the previous topic. `background-color` gives the reusable component a consistent surface.

