sketchBlocks.bodyMarkdown:
A reusable class becomes more valuable when later visual refinements can be made once and appear on every matching component.

**Worked example:**

```css
.card {
  border-radius: 0.75rem;
  border-color: #e2e8f0;
}
```

**Line by line:** `.card` reuses the same component boundary. `border-radius` softens every card corner. `border-color` standardizes the existing card borders in one place.

